65℃ 三维立体恒温热风，烘干被褥潮气。</p></li><li><p>杀菌除螨四重系统：UVC 紫外线 + 超声波 +65℃ 高温热风 + 可选植物香氛雾化</p></li><li><p>智能监测：大屏数字尘螨指数实时显示 + 三模式触控操作</p></li></ul><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="991" src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/2208483187186/O1CN01LhpWPb22xFHYLJCMG_!!2208483187186.jpg" title="试试 65°C 热风吹过的被窝：友望除螨仪 649 → 136 元新低，约 15500Pa 大吸力" width="750" /><img height="482" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/7/fcb6e03d-1398-4766-b361-f2f530e3ee61.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="试试 65°C 热风吹过的被窝：友望除螨仪 649 → 136 元新低，约 15500Pa 大吸力" width="750" /><img height="1086" src="https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/2208483187186/O1CN01XZzxO022xFHYT8626_!!2208483187186.jpg" title="试试 65°C 热风吹过的被窝：友望除螨仪 649 → 136 元新低，约 15500Pa 大吸力" width="750" /><img height="947" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/7/28feba50-ef9a-40d8-a2c4-7aabbebaef96.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="试试 65°C 热风吹过的被窝：友望除螨仪 649 → 136 元新低，约 15500Pa 大吸力" width="877" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=I4RS7ckpLuClhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJvGEI4bVZn3XSXQsBbSQqLMPSGT2Ry7vdDpIgkteQ%2FltiBIZtNgiL85P4yWaUF1Q92mwCY5fS7rVrTdT7cgXf6jgYSYpxmYtMsb%2Bvi71p7YhlXymvoVZzQ1NSV%2B5e99o1Vxbh4t4U042Ywek19h0d0NQV3tBpdKHodxJgRmH6PTUPrRT%2FGlevSUzgKIk6XTsliqP6wveQFBWrBNRUyvxLOHdNfYPVSJUH9sZAjpUzkt5og9rEA65fp4xa8eqHCnkcfzQLZmo3TtGjGwG5%2FUm0S6J7%2BkHL3AEW&amp;traceId=215045bb17859424547262408e0e76&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1785942454@214142f8_1470_19fd277320d_1511@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="448" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/7/a75e62c9-4611-48e1-82ae-80a6b84be833.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="试试 65°C 热风吹过的被窝：友望除螨仪 649 → 136 元新低，约 15500Pa 大吸力" width="448" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name"> UWANT 友望除螨仪</span></span><span class="card-abstrac